Governor Ilakk
DIALOGUE
"Who are you?"
"The Governor. I take care of those who enter through the portal."
DIALOGUE
"What happens with me?"
"You're free to walk around, although some may disagree. Don't start trouble mortal."
DIALOGUE
"Why can't I go back?"
"The portal only accepts immortals."
DIALOGUE
"How did I go through the portal?"
"We designed it to bring slaves here, the no-back feature was to stop escapees. You're one of many exceptions."
